<title>USA: British Airways plans to expand JFK terminal.</title>
<headline>British Airways plans to expand JFK terminal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said Thursday it plans to invest $100 million to expand its terminal at New York's John F. Kennedy International Airport and improve roadway access.</p>
</text>
